      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The cultist has taken damage and is neither Fatigued nor already in a frenzy</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The cultist flies into a frenzy that lasts 1 minute.</p>\n<p>While frenzied, the cultist gains a +1 status bonus to attack rolls and a +2 status bonus to damage rolls, and they take a –2 status penalty to AC. The cultist can't voluntarily stop their frenzy. After their frenzy, the cultist is fatigued.</p>",
